    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "23 Millfield is a charming one-bedroom, ground floor apartment ideally positioned within this highly sought-after Links development, directly opposite Portmarnock DART Station. The property offers superb natural light and well-proportioned accommodation throughout, while also benefiting from a private south/east balcony providing the perfect outdoor space to relax, unwind and enjoy the sunshine.\r\n\r\nBright and well-proportioned throughout this apartment will appeal to first-time buyers, downsizers and investors alike. Accommodation comprises of an inviting entrance hall with a large hot press, comfortable double bedroom with an abundance of fitted wardrobes, modern bathroom, kitchen with a bespoke breakfast bar and a spacious light-filled lounge/dining area. The basement parking is directly under the apartment with both stair and lift access only a few steps away.\r\n\r\nThe Links is a secure gated development with mature green areas, underground car parking and a family friendly environment. There is an onsite creche and with the DART station nearby it provides easy access to Malahide Village or Dublin City Centre."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance hall\t3.0 x 1.8     Decorative timber floor, large hot press, security phone\r\n \r\nKitchen\t2.76 x 2.0\tTiled floor, tiled splashback, fitted units, dishwasher, washing machine, fridge / freezer, hob, extractor fan, sprig light, bespoke breakfast bar\r\n\r\nLounge/Diner\t5.55 x 3.50\tDecorative timber floor, 2 x light fittings, shelving, storage closet, doors to large outdoor living space, bespoke breakfast bar\r\n\r\nBalcony\t6.19 x 2.05\tLarge outdoor living space\r\n\t\t\r\nBathroom\t2.18 x 1.70\tTiled floor & walls, w.c, w.h.b, bath suite with shower screen, mirror, fan, shaving light, handheld shower head\r\n\r\nMaster Bedroom\t4.35 x 2.54\tDecorative timber floor, light fitting, abundance of fitted wardrobes, lockers x 2."
      },
